export anchor MemphisStyle:
    number: 25
    screen: LandingPage
    name: Memphis
    idea: A 1980s Memphis poster, with squiggles, confetti shapes and clashing pastel and primary blocks thrown into a playful, off-balance layout.
    base: light
    palette:
        paper: #fff8ec, the page and fields
        white: #ffffff, cards and the style sheet
        ink: #121212, text, every 3px outline, stripe and dot patterns
        bubblegum: #ff7eb6, highlight blocks, the quote disc and the Overdue chip
        yolk: #ffd23f, the primary button, highlights and the At risk chip
        mint: #6be3c9, blocks, underline highlights, the focused field offset and the On track chip
        cobalt: #2442d6, squiggles, the closing band with white text and the focus outline
        lilac: #c7b4ff, sticker labels, one feature card and focused rows
        graphite: #4a4a4a, notes and secondary text
    type:
        Futura, Century Gothic, Avenir Next, Trebuchet MS, Gill Sans, URW
        Gothic, sans-serif. The headline is 96px extra bold at 0.95 line
        height with minus 0.04em tracking, section titles 60px extra bold,
        the quote 54px extra bold, feature titles 24px, the lede 20px, body
        17px at 1.55 and chips 13px extra bold.
    layout:
        A light top bar with a brand mark of a pink square, a yellow circle
        and a blue squiggle, plain nav links that turn into outlined mint
        blocks on hover, and a yellow Start free button. The hero is split
        unevenly. The left holds a tilted lilac sticker saying Hey, small
        teams, a headline with on one in a tilted pink block and calm page
        underlined by a blue squiggle, an indented lede with a thick cobalt
        left bar, and the buttons. The right is a pile of shapes, a yellow
        dotted disc, a striped mint square and a cobalt triangle, with a
        tilted white card listing three projects on top. Confetti such as
        rings, zigzags and crosses floats around. The logo strip is a black
        band with zigzag edges and names in differently shaped and tilted
        colour chips. Three feature cards are staggered at different
        heights, each a different colour with one big rounded corner. The
        quote sits beside a large pink disc with a cobalt square. The
        closing band is cobalt with a yellow circle and yellow squiggle.
        The footer has a dot grid and shaped colour headings. Below 980px
        everything stacks, and below 640px the nav wraps under the brand.
    spacing: An 8px unit but placement is uneven on purpose, with 48px indents and card offsets of 24 and 72px.
    density: Loose and busy at once. Few words, many shapes in the margins.
    corners: Mixed on purpose. Square blocks, full circles, and single 26 to 64px rounded corners on one side only.
    borders: 3px solid ink on every block, 2px dashed ink between list rows, zigzag edges on the logo band.
    shadows: No blur. Each block sits on an offset patterned twin of diagonal stripes, a dot grid or a solid colour, 14 to 17px down and right.
    icons:
        Large 64px filled geometric glyphs with 3px ink outlines, such as a
        target, a ticked square and a triangle with bars. Status chips use a
        filled circle for On track on a round mint chip, a triangle for At
        risk on a square yellow chip and a cross for Overdue on a pink chip
        with two rounded corners, each with the word.
    focus: A 3px dashed cobalt outline offset 4px, yellow on cobalt. A focused field also gets a solid mint offset block.
    tone: Cheerful and chatty, such as Hey, small teams and Three things it does really well.
